# text = Perhaps you have heard -- about Mr . Wildeve's fortune No Well , he has come into a fortune of eleven thousand pounds -- uncle died in Canada , just after hearing that all his family , whom he was sending home , had gone to the bottom in the _Cassiopeia_ ; so Wildeve has come into everything , without in the least expecting it How long has he known of this Well , it was known to him this morning early , for I knew it at ten o'clock , when Charley came back .
