# text = Three shillings a hundred , I heard Clym has money but he likes to earn a little Very well ; good night O I see it , I see it How much he wishes he had me now , that he might give me all I desire Had he been a man to bear a jilt ill-will he would have told me of his good fortune in crowing tones ; instead of doing that he mentioned not a word , in deference to my misfortunes , and merely implied that he loved me still , as one superior to him How did you come here I thought you were at home I went on to the village after leaving your garden ; and now I have come back again : that's all .
